    "text": "Short pale cream cotton socks, tightly fitted to the exact calf, ankle and foot silhouette. The plain foot has soft thin fabric; only the cuff has restrained fine ribs following the calf length. A clearly drawn thin cuff hem follows the calf cross-section, not the bent foot axis. No heavy stripes, skin pixels, logos or shoe. Cuff and foot are separate layer pieces; footwear hides only the foot piece. Procedural pose images are construction drafts, not final visual approvals."
